    "description": {
      "value": "\n<p><strong>Sephirotic Scion.</strong> Your blood remembers the higher spheres. Light hangs around you a little too long, prayers sometimes answer themselves, and the world’s moral architecture feels less like an abstraction and more like the weather report.</p><hr><p><em><strong>Sephirotic Scion Traits</strong></em></p><ul><li><p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Sephirotic).</p></li><li><p><strong>Size.</strong> You are Medium.</p></li><li><p><strong>Speed.</strong> Your walking speed is 6 squares</p></li><li><p><strong>attributes.</strong> Your background determines your attribute increases; Sephirotic Scion does not grant any attribute bonuses.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Sephirotic Scion Core.</strong> At character creation you gain <strong>The Higher Register</strong> (Sephirotic Physiology, Sefirot Attunement, Holy Conduit, Light of Harmony). Your heritage adds its own traits and Tier powers at Initiation 1, 5, 11 and 17.</p>",
